8.193.118   <none>                                     6379/TCP    4m32s\nuser-timeline-service    ClusterIP      10.101.86.176    <none>                                     9090/TCP    4m32s\n', id='204fd004-591d-4e70-a450-6ad575a087f7', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-94792beabad864b4'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='0a33b330-454d-4331-8db8-0f0d8a801537')]]
